{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p024a","title":"宋忠告刘备刘琮请降","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-p024a-account","label":"孔衍《汉魏春秋》","text":"刘琮命宋忠向刘备宣示降曹，刘备大怒而仍遣宋忠离去；又拒绝劫刘琮南走的建议。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p024a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-cong","role":"遣使","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p024a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0036","role":"宣旨","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p024a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"遣还拒劫","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p024a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"宛、樊之间","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p024a-q"]},"time":{"year":208,"label":"曹操在宛时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o024","basis":"曹操在宛时"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-p024a-q","xianzhu-q-o024","wudi-q-o119","wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c"]},"source_order":[32,131,"P024a"],"order":6538}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-cong","name":"刘琮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0036","name":"宋忠","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o119","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。作玄武池以肄舟师〖2〗。﹝一﹞汉罢三公官，置丞相、御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p024a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7601fa710fb53306a879","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞孔衍《汉魏春秋》曰：“刘琮乞降，不敢告备，备亦不知。久之乃觉，遣所亲问琮；琮令宋忠，诣备宣旨。是时曹公在宛，备乃大惊骇，谓忠曰：‘卿诸人作事如此，不早相语；今祸至方告我，不亦太剧乎！’引刀向忠曰：‘今断卿头，不足以解忿，亦耻大丈夫临别复杀卿辈！’遣忠去，乃呼部曲议。或劝备劫将琮及荆州吏士，径南到江陵。备答曰：‘刘荆州临亡，托我以孤遗；背信自济，吾所不为，死何面目以见刘荆州乎！’”","attribution":"孔衍《汉魏春秋》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":130,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-88da51863c1d2ebfc205","start":0,"end":194,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o024","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c857386227851cc86ab3","layer":"original","quote":"（曹公南征表）〔及曹公南征〕，会表卒，﹝二﹞子琮代立〖2〗，遣使请降。先主屯樊，不知曹公猝至；至宛乃闻之，遂将其众去。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
